operational context of this folder:

    blocking:
        no (-1) because "static documents"
        mitigation "none needed"

    health:
        system Base100 with scale from -100 to +100
        granted (1) above +50 meaning "pricing clear"
        deferred (0) within ±50 meaning "needs update"
        denied (-1) below -50 meaning "pricing unclear"

        operations:
            "pricing exists" scores +30 (1) for "documents present"
            "terms clear" scores +30 (1) for "unambiguous"
            "outdated" scores -20 (-1) for "needs refresh"

        cascade multipliers:
            "business" multiplies by 1.5 because "unclear pricing blocks sales"

